313037634526_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KgQmxg-eIj8Q7kNvwE5vUet&_nc_oc=Adq0aMN0Cn2fCSOSt05A-ezOsmo6tVFYqIMJlUaxoIth7EFbM87HCZ1zfuT97c-ir-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO5vHYOt58GV7F4XQsnxEb36dFkBEIvtqSQZQ-05a6KgA&oe=6ADF68AB"}, "display_name": "Outlaws Assassin - Demo", "keywords": ["western", "shooter", "strategy", "casual", "stealth"], "long_description": "You can find the full version through the link below\n\nhttps://www.meta.com/en-gb/experiences/outlaws-assassin-western-justice/28326306157013728\n\nStep into the boots of a lone gunslinger in this tactical Wild West VR shooter. Every level offers something new. Whether you're outsmarting bandits or saving hostages in a dusty desert town, your aim, timing, and tactics decide who survives the showdown.\n\nFeatures : \n\nUnique stealth mechanics using your trusty mirror (Ojo M\u00e1gico) to spot enemies around corners without exposing yourself\n{666629932799383}\n\nUse explosions, traps, and strategy \u2014 not just bullets\n\n{1175440533892252}\nStory-driven with humorous sheriff missions introducing each level.\n{1011192394320004}\nFirst-person Western action game built for VR\n\n{1091673586098228}\nCasual pacing, but rewarding for sharpshooters and sneaky players alike\n\nStylized low-poly visuals with gritty cowboy charm\n\n{601810062744161}\n\n\n\nPerfect for fans of:\nOutlaw shooter VR, Western stealth game, VR cowboy shooter, story-driven cowboy VR, and Wild West sniper VR experiences.\n\n\nJoin our Discord server\nhttps://discord.gg/Be4fR3Pn\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "\nOutlaws Assassin is a Wild West VR shooter blending strategy, stealth, and intense gunfights. Navigate desert towns and saloon showdowns. Upgrade weapons, track enemies with a unique mirror mechanic, and take on diverse missions. Save girls (hostages), rescue friends, take down bosses, and assassinate the devil executioner. Every move counts in the untamed frontier. Become t